<title>UK: Tambang Timah at $15.25 in London.</title>
<headline>Tambang Timah at $15.25 in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah closed at $15.25 per GDR in London on Thursday. It recorded the day's low of $15.125 and the day's high of $15.55.</p>
<p>It closed at $15.1250 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
